#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:3
msgid "远程访问：从任何地方连上你的GPU服务器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:5
msgid "GPU服务器很少在你手边——可能在机房，可能在云上，可能在朋友家阁楼里吃灰。你需要的是**在任何地方都能连上去跑训练、看loss曲线、查日志**的能力。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:7
msgid "这一节不讲理论，只讲实操。从最简单的SSH隧道到全家桶式的组网方案，按需选读就行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:9
msgid "SSH：不止是登上去敲命令"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`linux-basics`教了你密钥配置和基本连接。但深度学习场景下，SSH真正的大招是**隧道转发**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:15
msgid "把远程服务\"拉\"到本地来"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`ssh-setup`已经帮你配好了密钥和基本连接，但SSH的真正实力是**端口转发**。最常见的场景是：服务器上跑着Jupyter "
"Notebook，你想在本地浏览器打开它。SSH隧道就是干这个的："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:19
msgid ""
"# 把服务器的8888端口映射到本地的8888端口\n"
"ssh -L 8888:localhost:8888 user@your-server\n"
"\n"
"# 然后打开 http://localhost:8888 —— 实际上访问的是服务器上的Jupyter\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:26
msgid "三种隧道各有各的用处："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "什么时候用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "本地转发"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "`-L 本地端口:目标:目标端口`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "Jupyter、TensorBoard、Gradio——远程服务拉到本地看"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "远程转发"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "`-R 远程端口:本地:本地端口`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "让公网服务器帮你转发流量到内网机器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "动态转发"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "`-D 本地端口`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md
msgid "整台浏览器的流量全走服务器网络"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:34
msgid "把这些固定配置写进 `~/.ssh/config`，以后就不用每次敲长长一串了："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"# ~/.ssh/config\n"
"Host gpu-server\n"
"    HostName your-server-ip\n"
"    User anson\n"
"    # 自动映射Jupyter和TensorBoard端口\n"
"    LocalForward 8888 localhost:8888\n"
"    LocalForward 6006 localhost:6006\n"
"    # 保持心跳，防止长时间训练后断开\n"
"    ServerAliveInterval 60\n"
"    ServerAliveCountMax 3\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:49
msgid "一个要命的细节"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:52
msgid ""
"通过SSH隧道访问Jupyter时，Jupyter必须只监听 `localhost`（`--ip=127.0.0.1`），**绝对不能**监听 "
"`0.0.0.0`。否则你的Notebook就直接暴露在公网上了，任何人都能访问。这个原则同样适用于TensorBoard、Gradio、Streamlit——只要是通过SSH隧道访问的服务，绑定到127.0.0.1就对了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:55
msgid "VSCode Remote SSH"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:57
msgid ""
"如果你用VSCode写代码，Remote SSH插件比Jupyter的体验好一个数量级——本地写代码，远程执行，文件自动同步。装了插件之后 "
"`Ctrl+Shift+P` → `Remote-SSH: Connect to Host` 选服务器就行。它自动读 "
"`~/.ssh/config` 里的配置，设好的隧道和别名都能用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:59
msgid "效果就是：代码在GPU服务器上跑，但编辑体验和在本地完全一样。断网了重连一下，编辑器状态全在。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:61
msgid "过跳板机（ProxyJump）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:63
msgid "很多实验室和云环境的GPU服务器躲在私有子网里，不能直接访问。你得先登上一台**跳板机**（堡垒机），再通过它跳到GPU服务器："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:65
msgid ""
"# 原始方案：两步走\n"
"ssh user@jump-server\n"
"# 在跳板机上再执行\n"
"ssh user@gpu-server\n"
"\n"
"# 优雅方案：ProxyJump一步到位\n"
"ssh -J user@jump-server user@gpu-server\n"
"\n"
"# 如果跳板机端口不是默认的22\n"
"ssh -J user@jump-server:2222 user@gpu-server\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:78
msgid "写进 `~/.ssh/config` 就更清爽了："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:80
msgid ""
"Host jump-server\n"
"    HostName jump.company.com\n"
"    User anson\n"
"\n"
"Host gpu-server\n"
"    HostName 10.0.1.100\n"
"    User anson\n"
"    ProxyJump jump-server\n"
"    # 还可以同时配端口转发，穿透两层\n"
"    LocalForward 8888 localhost:8888\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:93
msgid ""
"配置好后一句 `ssh gpu-server` 就自动经过跳板机直连GPU服务器，隧道也一并建立。如果不方便装OpenSSH "
"7.3以上版本（ProxyJump需要），也可以用老的 `ProxyCommand` 模式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:95
msgid ""
"Host gpu-server\n"
"    HostName 10.0.1.100\n"
"    User anson\n"
"    ProxyCommand ssh jump-server -W %h:%p\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:104
msgid "mosh：容忍你切WiFi、掉线、高延迟"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:106
msgid "SSH有一个天生的毛病：**网络一不稳定就断**。你在咖啡厅连服务器看loss曲线，站起来换了个位置，WiFi切了一下——SSH卡死了，只能重连。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:108
msgid ""
"mosh（Mobile "
"Shell）就是来解决这个问题的。它在SSH的基础上加了一层UDP会话，能容忍IP地址变化、网络延迟波动、甚至电脑合盖再打开："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:110
msgid ""
"# 安装mosh（服务端和客户端都需要）\n"
"sudo apt install mosh\n"
"\n"
"# 连接（和ssh用法基本一样）\n"
"mosh user@your-server\n"
"\n"
"# 如果SSH端口不是22\n"
"mosh --ssh=\"ssh -p 2222\" user@your-server\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:121
msgid "连接上之后试试：断开WiFi换成手机热点——mosh不会断，敲几个回车就恢复了。对于\"在高铁上看loss曲线\"这种场景来说，mosh比tmux续命更直接——tmux保证**会话**不丢，mosh保证**连接**不丢，两者搭配最佳。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:123
msgid "mosh的限制"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:126
msgid "mosh不支持SSH隧道转发（-L/-R/-D参数）。所以mosh适合日常查状态、敲命令、看日志。如果你需要端口转发（Jupyter、TensorBoard），还是得用SSH隧道。实际工作流通常是：mosh上去启动训练，SSH隧道开Jupyter看结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:131
msgid "tailscale：零配置组网，像在同一局域网"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:133
msgid "tailscale是一个建立在WireGuard之上的组网工具。它的核心价值一句话就能说清楚：**让分布在世界各地的机器像在同一个局域网里一样通信**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:135
msgid "什么时候你需要它"
msgstr ""

