#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:144
msgid "真·三步搞定"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:146
msgid ""
"# 第1步：所有设备都装\n"
"curl -fsSL https://tailscale.com/install.sh | sh\n"
"\n"
"# 第2步：启动并登录（会弹出浏览器让你认证）\n"
"sudo tailscale up\n"
"\n"
"# 第3步：查看分配到的IP\n"
"tailscale status\n"
"# 100.x.x.x    server    username@  linux\n"
"# 100.x.x.y    laptop    username@  macOS\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:159
msgid ""
"之后就简单了：`ssh anson@100.x.x.x` 代替 `ssh "
"anson@公网IP`。tailscale自动处理NAT穿透、加密传输和身份认证。你不需要在服务器上开放任何端口，tailscale会自己想办法打洞连上你。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:161
msgid "免费套餐够用吗？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:164
msgid "个人用户完全够。最多100台设备，支持子网路由和ACL访问控制。如果你只是连自己的一台GPU服务器加一台笔记本，免费套餐绰绰有余。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:167
msgid "进阶：让你的服务器当\"网桥\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:169
msgid "如果GPU服务器在一个局域网里（比如学校实验室），旁边还有NAS、另一台服务器、共享存储——你想通过tailscale访问整个内网："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:171
msgid ""
"# 在服务器上通告整个192.168.1.0/24子网\n"
"sudo tailscale up --advertise-routes=192.168.1.0/24\n"
"\n"
"# 然后在 tailscale 管理后台（https://login.tailscale.com）开启子网路由\n"
"# 之后不管你在哪里，都可以通过192.168.1.x访问实验室的任意设备\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:181
msgid "frp：没有公网IP？找个\"中转站\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:183
msgid "tailscale虽然好，但有些场景它搞不定：网络环境把UDP封了、你需要**对外暴露HTTP服务**（比如给别人用模型API）、或者就是不能用tailscale。这时候frp上场。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:185
msgid "frp需要一个**有公网IP的机器**当中转。你的请求先发到中转服务器，它再转发给你的GPU服务器："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:197
msgid "中转端配置（公网服务器）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:199
msgid ""
"# frps.toml —— 就这么几行\n"
"bindPort = 7000\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:204
msgid ""
"# 启动\n"
"./frps -c frps.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:209
msgid "GPU服务器配置（没公网IP的那台）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:211
msgid ""
"# frpc.toml\n"
"serverAddr = \"你的公网服务器IP\"\n"
"serverPort = 7000\n"
"\n"
"# 把SSH暴露到公网的6000端口\n"
"[[proxies]]\n"
"name = \"ssh\"\n"
"type = \"tcp\"\n"
"localIP = \"127.0.0.1\"\n"
"localPort = 22\n"
"remotePort = 6000\n"
"\n"
"# 把Jupyter暴露到公网的8888端口\n"
"[[proxies]]\n"
"name = \"jupyter\"\n"
"type = \"tcp\"\n"
"localIP = \"127.0.0.1\"\n"
"localPort = 8888\n"
"remotePort = 8888\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:233
msgid ""
"# 启动\n"
"./frpc -c frpc.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:238
msgid ""
"之后 `ssh anson@公网服务器IP -p 6000` 就连上了你的GPU服务器，Jupyter在浏览器打开 `公网服务器IP:8888` "
"就能用。"
msgstr ""

