msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:270
msgid "iptables：给你的服务器上个锁"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:272
#, python-brace-format
msgid "结合{ref}`tailscale-basics`的\"默认就在加密网络里\"，加上iptables的精细控制，你的服务器基本安全就有了保障。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:274
msgid "前面说的都是\"怎么连进来\"的问题。还有一个反面问题：**怎么不让不该连的人连进来**。深度学习服务器放在公网上，半小时内就会收到各种扫描和爆破尝试。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:276
msgid "iptables是Linux最底层的防火墙，你不需要成为专家，但掌握几条规则能让服务器安全很多："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:278
msgid ""
"# 先看看当前有什么规则\n"
"sudo iptables -L -n -v\n"
"\n"
"# 只允许你的IP连SSH（其他人都滚蛋）\n"
"sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 22 -s 你的IP地址 -j ACCEPT\n"
"\n"
"# 允许你实验室的整个网段访问模型API\n"
"sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 8080 -s 192.168.1.0/24 -j ACCEPT\n"
"\n"
"# 除此以外所有访问8080的请求都拒绝\n"
"sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 8080 -j DROP\n"
"\n"
"# 但已经连上的连接不要断（不然你正在跑的SSH会被自己踢掉）\n"
"sudo iptables -A INPUT -m state --state ESTABLISHED,RELATED -j ACCEPT\n"
"\n"
"# 默认策略：进门全关，出门全开\n"
"sudo iptables -P INPUT DROP\n"
"sudo iptables -P FORWARD DROP\n"
"sudo iptables -P OUTPUT ACCEPT\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:300
msgid "如果你想把同一个端口换个映射（比如外网8080对应内网Jupyter的8888）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:302
msgid ""
"sudo iptables -t nat -A PREROUTING -p tcp --dport 8080 -j REDIRECT --to-"
"port 8888\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:306
msgid "**保存规则让重启后还在**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:308
msgid ""
"sudo apt install iptables-persistent\n"
"sudo netfilter-persistent save\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/remote-access.md:313
msgid "别把自己锁在外面"
